        <owl:annotatedTarget>A specialized, columnar, mucus secreting epithelial cell shaped like a flask or goblet. A narrow basal end contains the nucleus while the apical end is swollen by the accumulation of mucus laden secretory granules.  Short microvilli project from the apical plasma membrane.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MESH:D020397</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goblet_cell</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
