        <owl:annotatedTarget>An elicited macrophage that is recruited into the tissues in response to injury and infection as part of an inflammatory response, expresses high levels of pro-inflammatory cytokines, ROS and NO, and shows potent microbicidal activity.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:ana</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
