        <obo:IAO_0000115>A germinal center B cell that founds a germinal center, and has the phenotype IgD-positive, CD38-positive, and CD23-negative.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Bm2&apos; B lymphocyte</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
