        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>centrocyte</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Bm4 B cells are also reportedly CD10-positive, CD23-negative, CD39-negative, CD44-positive, and CD71-positive.</rdfs:comment>
