        <obo:IAO_0000115>A memory B cell arising in the germinal center that is IgD-negative and has undergone somatic mutation of the variable region of the immunoglobulin heavy and light chain genes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Bm5 B lymphocyte</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
