        <rdfs:comment>These are precursors to mature T cells; normally, they do not circulate, but are found in the thymus and they have not undergone rearrangement of the alpha and beta T cell receptor genes.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>double negative thymocyte</rdfs:label>
